# Typography

A consistent typography component for various text variants (h1-h4, p, span, blockquote) with responsive sizing and standard Shadcn UI styling.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/typography.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/typography.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/typography.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { Typography } from '@/registry/typography'
</script>

<template>
  <Typography 
    variant="h1" 
    text="Modern Typography" 
  />
</template>
```

