### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `variant` | `string` | `undefined` | The typography variant: `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `h4`, `p`, `span`, `blockquote`. |
| `text` | `string` | `undefined` | The text content to display. |
